1.0.1 2026-11-18
  - 65 sub-*/nirs/*_channels.tsv: channel names written as MNE-Python derives them from the SNIRF measurement list ("S1-D1-760.0" -> "S1_D1 760"); row order and the other columns unchanged
  - 65 *_coordsystem.json: NIRSCoordinateSystemDescription added (BIDS requires it when NIRSCoordinateSystem is Other)
  - 65 *_nirs.json: Manufacturer Gowerlabs and ManufacturersModelName LUMO added (doi:10.1162/imag.a.1208, section 2.2 Experimental paradigm and recording); RecordingDuration and RecordingType computed from the SNIRF time vector of each recording
  - sourcedata/: the published versions of the 65 tables whose values change in this version, byte-identical at the same relative path
  - README.md: new section "Contributed notes (version 1.0.1)"
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
